{"pageid": 768, "title": "Henry", "revid": 1677, "categories": ["Characters", "Humans", "Archer's Peak", "Characters (SIKTC comics)"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Henry</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/3/3a/Henry11.png/revision/latest?cb=20241215171418\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Henry11\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/3/3a/Henry11.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241215171418\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/3/3a/Henry11.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241215171418 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/3/3a/Henry11.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20241215171418 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Henry11\" width=\"270\" height=\"355\" data-image-key=\"Henry11.png\" data-image-name=\"Henry11.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Biographical Information</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"species\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Species</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Human</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Alive</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"occupation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Occupation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">House Depot cashier</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Relationships</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"affiliation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Affiliation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Archer%27s_Peak\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak\">Archer's Peak</a><br />House Depot</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"relatives\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Relatives</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Unnamed wife<br /><p>Unnamed son<br /></p></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Appearances</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"first_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">First Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_3\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 3\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #3</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"last_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Last Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_15\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 15\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #15</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<blockquote class=\"pull-quote\">\n\t<div class=\"pull-quote&#95;&#95;text\">He'd step up, he'd step up because he knew he had to, and there was no... no resentment. No 'why me?' He did it without a second thought, like I never did. I still don't know <i>where</i> he got it, but those were always the moments that stuck. Not the ones that made me think of the baby. I remember the times I saw the <i>man.</i> The man he should have become.</div>\n\t<p style=\"text-align: right\"><cite>—Henry to Bartender, <a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_3\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 3\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #3</a></cite></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><b>Henry</b> is the father of an unnamed boy who was killed during the monster attacks.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Physical_appearance\">Physical appearance</span></h2>\n<p>Henry is an older African American man with grey hair.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Something_Is_Killing_the_Children\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_3\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 3\">Issue #3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_4\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 4\">Issue #4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_11\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 11\">Issue #11</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_15\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 15\">Issue #15</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"e52aa03535ad9662472c087af51e99ac\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-capt